{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_02_title", "source_sha256": "1b4cb564a832b8d3a5f1788263bfdebbaa7250bf35a0e2480180af2ebec2a912", "ja": "#水上ゲーム　#飛び入りOK？", "zh": "#水上游戏　#临时参加OK？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "98519576c806701caab259f1232e650ae941212d718ade866cf6b94833de3109", "ja": "麗花と風花が水上ゲームの中継をしていると\n迷子のあずさがやってくる。水上ゲームに\n参加する麗花とあずさ。司会に徹する風花\nだったが、リアルタイムの視聴者投票で\n水上ゲームへの参加が決定してしまう。", "zh": "丽花和风花正在进行水上游戏的转播时，\n迷路的梓来到了这里。丽花和梓参加了水上游戏。\n原本只负责主持的风花，\n却因为实时观众投票，\n也决定参加水上游戏。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_02_1000_p", "source_sha256": "6acf9cba16b383dc3e4ad3beeb97b89c01a73058b2e3155b64ba7e3a3297e02b", "ja": "（生配信が始まった！　視聴者数も上々で、滑り出しは\n問題なさそうだ。さて、次のコーナーは……）", "zh": "（直播开始了！观众人数也相当不错，开局似乎没有什么问题。那么，下一个环节是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_02_1001_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f84358760d2cf5b9228114aa8a763b033de07be24e3287bcecb6e89c08f023ab", "ja": "続いては、水上ゲームエリアのご紹介です～！\nここで楽しめるゲームの種類は、なんと765種類！", "zh": "接下来要为大家介绍的是水上游戏区～！\n这里可以体验的游戏种类，竟然有765种！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_02_1002_041fuk", "source_sha256": "88fdd7c87cb33223c6155f7776ac1436036ef0d582b5c9cc3e3ab55264e8091b", "ja": "今日はその中から、『フロート渡り』をご紹介します！\nこちらに参加者の皆さんが……あれ？　麗花ちゃん？", "zh": "今天要为大家介绍其中的“浮板渡河”！\n参加者们将在这里……咦？丽花？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_02_1003_048rei", "source_sha256": "8c6e217e3f1a42f58c246da32c12f7413d1557e5260ed4bf50e0190c016e86b2", "ja": "はーい！　楽しそうなので、私も参加しまーす！\nざぶ～ん！　ざぶ～ん！！", "zh": "好——！看起来很有意思，我也要参加——！\n哗啦——！哗啦——！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_02_1004_048rei", "source_sha256": "276cc2e2938765f37043bcae61f495952607dd69c93361e13a4d38097d098527", "ja": "あれ、ざぶ～んとなったら負けでしたっけ？\nじゃあじゃあ、最後まで落っこちないよう頑張ります！", "zh": "咦，要是掉进水里就算输了吗？\n那那，为了能坚持到最后不掉下去，我会加油的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_02_1005_010azu", "source_sha256": "285a9bbcf147dcadb88e2e543cf13de97329d7bcdeb458846db73605674a423d", "ja": "あ、風花ちゃん。ちょうど良かったわ、\nフードエリアの場所って……。もしかして、撮影中？", "zh": "啊，风花。正好遇到你了，\n美食区的位置……难道说，你正在拍摄吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_02_1006_041fuk", "source_sha256": "c430e770b5e7c58ed2a817e7f8d02a0e2e47bcffe2ac5ac7a4591199deca5844", "ja": "あっ、はい！　今は、水上ゲームエリアの説明中で……\nあの、よかったらあずささんも参加しませんか？", "zh": "啊，好的！现在正在介绍水上游戏区……\n那个，如果不介意的话，阿梓小姐也要参加吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_02_1007_010azu", "source_sha256": "0f150f9be0aa71eb346079b32d164bc040eb30c6176c1906ea216506ebd4c4da", "ja": "まあ、私も？\nけど飛び入りなんて、いいのかしら……？", "zh": "咦，我也可以参加吗？\n不过临时加入，真的没关系吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_02_1008_048rei", "source_sha256": "5122d1723cfbbcea06b294aca1616749975a2e82851de8ff311b6c30278a9bf9", "ja": "大丈夫ですよ！\n風花さんも一緒ですから♪", "zh": "没问题的！\n因为风花也一起嘛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_02_1009_041fuk", "source_sha256": "4394bc7c9ccd3bf01145d9870fdd33d4997a2581ca2073b2519aaffde8cb3fcd", "ja": "えっ、あれ？　私は司会だけで、\nゲームには参加しないはずじゃ……。", "zh": "诶，咦？我应该只负责主持，不参加游戏才对……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_02_1010_010azu", "source_sha256": "1b8e618fc2ee6472a707b95c66c9e3f42e433f555c4fbda4d8f5211ae97df9f4", "ja": "あっ……！　風花ちゃん、\n向こうでスタッフさんがカンペを……。", "zh": "啊……！风花，那边的工作人员拿着提词板……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_02_1011_048rei", "source_sha256": "174bba83ad73d48e72c5ed0518c7d8699e77c70a31dc2a73204ed4c62432f154", "ja": "ぱんぱかぱーん！　「リアルタイム視聴者投票で\n決まった、水上ゲーム大会に参加してほしいアイドル」", "zh": "锵锵锵！“通过实时观众投票决定的，希望参加水上游戏大会的偶像”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_02_1012_048rei", "source_sha256": "588926b56e706ecbf439231b1e05aa77804432a1f74ab047afe5e94161de4280", "ja": "第1位、豊川風花さんです♪　というわけで、\n風花さんも参加してくださいね！", "zh": "第1名，是丰川风花先生♪　那么，风花也请参加吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_02_1013_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f61dadf923a03c75aba716e1e1beecbb0dc9367828709dd2b159bc7735ebf383", "ja": "ええっ！？　わ、私！？\nどうしよう……！", "zh": "咦！？我、我吗！？\n怎么办……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_02_1014_010azu", "source_sha256": "37c3b558a83eb4db09e1ef9712cdcc0f178e341aa26a8f5c9f18f18ffe9163f5", "ja": "ふふっ。とっても期待されてるのね、風花ちゃん！", "zh": "嘻嘻，风花很受期待呢！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_02_1015_010azu", "source_sha256": "267136b7e909bedbd7d20c14a8aa53b8862bcd480c3ed86af0ac6448cce3c293", "ja": "せっかく投票してもらったんですもの。\n結果は気にせず、参加だけでもしてみたら？", "zh": "难得大家都投票支持你。别在意结果，至少参加一下试试吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_02_1016_041fuk", "source_sha256": "427ad12b11644381a650058d3b52b0c0cf4208e65761daaccc3b7715ffeaaa8d", "ja": "わ……わかりました！　突然のことで驚きましたけど、\n覚悟を決めて……頑張りますっ！", "zh": "我……我明白了！虽然事发突然让我吓了一跳，\n但我会下定决心……努力的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_02_1017_048rei", "source_sha256": "c0648b1b4339827d099f33df7c204a27ece903d6941d1303b632d48800b12daa", "ja": "パチパチパチ～♪　風花さん、カッコいいですね！\nあずささん、私たちも頑張りましょうね♪", "zh": "啪啪啪～♪　风花小姐，真帅气呢！\n梓小姐，我们也一起加油吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_02_1018_010azu", "source_sha256": "838ac56558307ab89c28f1f489b12897245f10f374ac48041a41e83c84d966c1", "ja": "うふふ、そうね。\n落ちないように、頑張ってみましょうか！", "zh": "呵呵，是呀。\n争取别掉下去，努力试试看吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0292_story_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0292_story_02_1019_p", "source_sha256": "235ae683174aba48d2c9f994a13972fb71e1c07ba7fb64eddceedafe40656100", "ja": "（なかなか難しいゲームだが、画面映えはバツグンだ！\nとはいえ、ハプニングには気を付けておこう……！）", "zh": "（虽然是个相当难的游戏，但在画面上的表现绝佳！不过，还是要小心别出什么意外……！）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
